iary uncertainty from the liability threshold to the damages phase. Developers face the same litigation risk whether the mens-rea inquiry is a threshold or a multiplier. The evidentiary uncertainty is identical. Every month of delay in deploying medical AI, autonomous transport, or automated diagnostics has a body count the liability frame does not count. When the legal system freezes development out of hypothetical fear, it chooses to let people die today of diseases automation could solve. Who gave that system the right to make that choice for them?",
